00:37:02.340 --> 00:37:09.100
Clark, the time comes in everybody's life

00:37:09.100 --> 00:37:11.400
when they realize their parents aren't going to be around forever.

00:37:12.460 --> 00:37:13.220
Dad, I...

00:37:13.220 --> 00:37:14.539
Clark, I just...

00:37:14.539 --> 00:37:18.940
