00:37:19.039 --> 00:37:20.539
It's not a sacrifice, Dad.

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:22.200
It's a choice.

00:37:28.620 --> 00:37:30.620
It's a really fine line, don't you think?

00:37:32.340 --> 00:37:34.380
Dad, I get the feeling we could talk about this all night

00:37:34.380 --> 00:37:35.640
and you're still not going to understand.

00:37:36.740 --> 00:37:38.640
Oh, I understand a whole lot more than you think.

00:37:38.820 --> 00:37:39.079
Right.

00:37:39.400 --> 00:37:41.100
That's why you came up here to change my mind.

00:37:43.100 --> 00:37:44.760
Dad, you raised me to make my own decisions.

00:37:44.880 --> 00:37:46.039
Why don't you trust me on this?

00:37:51.940 --> 00:37:53.500
Because you are a lot like me.

00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:57.019
I had a full ride to meet you waiting for me when I graduated.

00:37:58.620 --> 00:38:00.780
Problem is, my father needed me on this farm.

00:38:02.340 --> 00:38:05.340
So I stayed.

00:38:09.240 --> 00:38:11.360
Dad, that's a pretty big footnote to leave out.

00:38:12.380 --> 00:38:13.460
Why didn't you tell me?

00:38:15.460 --> 00:38:16.980
I didn't want it to weigh you down.

00:38:20.740 --> 00:38:23.100
As much as I loved my father, I...

00:38:24.519 --> 00:38:27.660
Part of me still resents him for needing me that much.

00:38:28.860 --> 00:38:30.200
I don't want you to feel that.

00:38:30.740 --> 00:38:32.100
That's not the kind of father I...

00:38:32.340 --> 00:38:34.460
I ever wanted to be.

00:38:42.780 --> 00:38:43.180
Dad.

00:38:46.340 --> 00:38:48.240
This isn't about the kind of father you are.

00:38:53.920 --> 00:38:55.740
It's about the kind of son I want to be.

00:38:55.740 --> 00:38:55.820
I want to be.

00:39:02.340 --> 00:39:02.840
Yeah.

00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:04.860
