00:39:04.860 --> 00:39:05.559
Uh...

00:39:11.260 --> 00:39:17.860
All right?

00:39:17.860 --> 00:39:20.059
You never feel

00:39:20.059 --> 00:39:22.980
What you are is real

00:39:22.980 --> 00:39:27.120
