00:39:49.940 --> 00:39:56.100
You lost when you come down

00:39:56.100 --> 00:40:00.039
Can't believe that you're on the ground

00:40:00.039 --> 00:40:05.400
Having us sleeping around the way

00:40:05.400 --> 00:40:10.980
Mother's gone

00:40:10.980 --> 00:40:13.360
